# Build context for the root-context images (docker/Dockerfile.rust, Dockerfile.api).
# Without this, `COPY . .` ships multi-GB of host build output to the daemon and bakes
# it into the image, where it is at best dead weight and at worst stale artifacts from a
# different toolchain.
target/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.next/

.git/
.direnv/
scratch/
result
result-*

# Not needed to build anything.
docs/
.github/
*.md
